          <h2 class="pipe">A Legacy of Quality Construction Throughout Massachusetts</h2>
          <p class="zz">S. Phaneuf & Associates has been providing professional construction services throughout Massachusetts since 1989. For more than 35 years, we have helped homeowners, businesses, and property managers improve their properties through quality craftsmanship, reliable service, and carefully planned construction.</p>
          <p class="zz">Our portfolio includes masonry and hardscape construction, asphalt paving, excavation and site development, and commercial snow and ice management. From custom patios, outdoor kitchens, retaining walls, and pool decks to residential driveways, commercial parking lots, and large-scale site improvements, every project is planned around the property's existing conditions, intended use, and long-term performance.</p>
          <p class="zz">Explore our completed construction projects to see examples of our work throughout Massachusetts. Whether you're planning a residential outdoor living project or a commercial construction project, our portfolio provides examples of the quality workmanship and practical solutions we bring to every project.</p>
      </section>


