      <section id="featured-construction-pics" >
          <h2 class="pipe">Featured Construction Projects in Massachusetts</h2>
          <p >Our work represents the range of residential and commercial construction projects completed by S. Phaneuf & Associates throughout Massachusetts. Every project has different requirements, from working with existing grades and drainage to selecting materials that complement the property and designing spaces around how they will be used.</p>
          <p >Our experience includes custom masonry and hardscaping, outdoor living spaces, asphalt paving, excavation, site development, and other property improvements. Projects may include sloped backyards requiring retaining walls and careful grading, pool areas requiring new walkways and drainage, or commercial properties requiring paving, excavation, drainage improvements, and ongoing snow management.</p>
          <p >We look at the entire property rather than treating each feature as a separate job. We consider how the finished project will function, how people will move through the space, how water will drain, and how the materials will perform over time.</p>
          <p >Whether you're planning a custom patio, outdoor kitchen, retaining wall, pool deck, asphalt driveway, excavation project, or commercial site improvement, we can help you develop a practical construction solution that fits your property and goals.</p>
      </section>
         

      <!--More Than Beautiful Backyards -->
      <section id="portfolio-closing" >
        <h2 class="pipe">More Than Beautiful Backyards</h2>
        <p >Successful construction requires more than choosing attractive materials or a particular design. It requires careful planning, proper site preparation, quality construction, and attention to how the finished space will be used.</p>
        <p >Our work extends beyond patios and outdoor living spaces. We build retaining walls, walkways, pool decks, outdoor kitchens, fireplaces, fire pits, stone steps, and other masonry features. We also provide asphalt paving, excavation, grading, drainage, site development, and commercial snow and ice management.</p>
        <p >Whether you are improving a residential property or planning a commercial project, we can help develop a practical solution based on your property's existing conditions, your goals, and the way the space needs to function.</p>
        <p >From consultation through completion, our goal is to provide dependable service and quality workmanship built to withstand the demands of Massachusetts properties and weather conditions.</p>
        <a href="/contact-us#contact-form" class="btn btn-primary ">Request a Free Consultation</a>
